  "visual_review_status": "Fresh producer inspections are recorded for all ten pinned versions. Independent exact-checksum reviews by scouts f, g and h pass all ten selections against the final plan and contracts. S003 v004 retains its disclosed gold floral patch on the well-stage Matsya. S009 v005 reviewer h reports Matsya at roughly 205 px wide and an ochre/gold gill-boundary band; h notes the plan says the pursuit is at a distance without a relative-size requirement, and that the band is not disclosed in the plan, but treats both as non-failing observations under the review threshold. S010 v009’s tiered crown and jewelry are recorded as ornament observations, not explicit contract failures. No artwork is approved.",
  "description": "Ten native D032 landscape candidates paired with their stanza-mapped supplied reference photographs and verbatim vetted captions. Some stanzas have multiple mapped source photos; every mapped photo is included in the comparison. Candidate versions and SHA-256 values are pinned per stanza; no generated artwork is approved.",
  "review_notice": "Unapproved D032 landscape candidate comparison. Independent exact-checksum review passes all ten selected versions. The disclosed S003 v004 gold floral patch is present. Reviewer h also reports that S009 v005 Matsya is about 205 px wide at a distance and has an ochre/gold gill-boundary band; the report notes the plan has no relative-scale requirement and does not disclose the band, and treats these as observations under the clarified threshold. Reviewer g notes S010 v009’s crown and jewelry as ornament observations. Publishing does not approve artwork. Portrait production is paused and no sourced English translations are available.",
